OL,3,GNEWSARemote GP phone services to be
OL,4,Arolled out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA remote GP telephone service is
OL,7,Fexpanding to more practices across the
OL,8,FIsle of Man from this week.
OL,10,FPatients will still contact their
OL,11,Fpractice as normal, with a triage
OL,12,Fprocess deciding who is offered a phone
OL,13,Fconsultation and face-to-face
OL,14,Fappointments still being arranged when
OL,15,Fneeded.
OL,17,FThe service follows a successful pilot
OL,18,Fin Ramsey.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
