OL,3,GNEWSARemote GP phone services to be
OL,4,Arolled out
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx Care said the approach could mean
OL,7,Fquicker access to medical advice,
OL,8,Fmedication reviews and ongoing support
OL,9,Ffor patients who do not need a physical
OL,10,Fexamination, without having to attend
OL,11,Fthe practice in person.
